        ],
        "text": "Oral argument began at 10:04\u202fa.m. before the Supreme Court."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4ee85ab0f9b2d14fbe7ea29415c1d1f412050c81be1e65e782a08a3ec8282e6f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4ee85ab0f9b2-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked, \u201cExcuse me. By its plain terms?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4ee85ab0f9b2d14fbe7ea29415c1d1f412050c81be1e65e782a08a3ec8282e6f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4ee85ab0f9b2-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, he followed with, \u201cRead it to me, would you?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4ee85ab0f9b2d14fbe7ea29415c1d1f412050c81be1e65e782a08a3ec8282e6f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4ee85ab0f9b2-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked why Congress took the drafting approach it did."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4ee85ab0f9b2d14fbe7ea29415c1d1f412050c81be1e65e782a08a3ec8282e6f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4ee85ab0f9b2-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, he inquired about review by the Merit Systems Protection Board."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4ee85ab0f9b2d14fbe7ea29415c1d1f412050c81be1e65e782a08a3ec8282e6f",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4ee85ab0f9b2-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked whether a retaliation claim could proceed through the EEOC and then to court."
      }
    ],
